# Revisions to skip in `git blame`. Enable locally with:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# Pure relocations and formatting-only commits belong here. Never a commit that
# changes behaviour.
#
# This repository squash-merges, so a branch commit SHA does not survive the
# merge. Add the SHA that lands on main, after it lands. An SHA that does not
# resolve makes `git blame` fail for everyone who enables this file.
